    "title": "Hibbing police put the cuffs on cancer with pink patches - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago The Hibbing Police are 'Putting the Cuffs on Cancer' in honor of Breast Cancer Awareness Month. They're sporting pink patches in support of local cancer patients as well as offering patches, t-shirts, and cups for sale. Proceeds from the merch goes to Angel Fund, which provides financial assistance to cancer patients. Read full article",
